{
  "item": [
    {
      "id": "ec5dba50-f496-4efe-a531-70245264d04c",
      "name": "Organizations",
      "description": {
        "content": "\nThe Organizations API gives you access to control and manage your Permit organizations.\n\nAn organization represents a **single billable account** (i.e: a company using Permit).\nYou may invite your team members to your Permit account, and thus multiple team members\nmay control an organization simultaniously (each member has access according to his role).\n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
      "item": [
        {
